_refine_special_details
;
Framework-only checkpoint. No solvent/guest atoms. Hydrogen positions not assigned. Do not treat as publication-validated.
The space group is supported by the input symmetry and strong-reflection equivalence.
The cell and wavelength are copied from start.ins; cell uncertainties and collection temperature are unknown.
Unit-cell atom inventory: Zr 18, O 96, C 264
The formula, formula weight and Z are left unknown because node protonation and pore content are not determined.
